<!-- SECTION 7.5: Forward Signals (Phase 2, zero weight)    -->
<!-- Deliberately outside the SQGLP element sections above: -->
<!-- nothing here contributed to the composite, and the     -->
<!-- reader must never have to infer that.                  -->
